#: en/./developers/writing-extensions.md:215
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "JavaScript events"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (javascript)
#: en/./developers/writing-extensions.md:217
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"function use_context() {\n"
"\t// Something that refers to the window.context\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"if (document.readyState && document.readyState !== 'loading' && typeof "
"window.context !== 'undefined' && typeof window.context.extensions !== "
"'undefined') {\n"
"\tuse_context();\n"
"} else {\n"
"\tdocument.addEventListener('freshrss:globalContextLoaded', use_context, "
"false);\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./developers/writing-extensions.md:232
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"`freshrss:globalContextLoaded`: will be dispatched after load the global "
"`context` variable, useful for referencing variables injected with the "
"`Minz_HookType::JsVars` hook."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: en/./developers/writing-extensions.md:233
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Injecting CDN content"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./developers/writing-extensions.md:238
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"When using the `init` method, it is possible to inject scripts from CDN "
"using the `Minz_View::appendScript` directive.  FreshRSS will include the "
"script in the page but will not load it since it will be blocked by the "
"default content security policy (**CSP**).  To amend the existing CSP, you "
"need to define the extension CSP policies:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: en/./developers/writing-extensions.md:238
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// in the extension.php file\n"
"protected array $csp_policies = [\n"
"\t'default-src' => 'example.org',\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./developers/writing-extensions.md:245
#, markdown-text
msgid "This will only amend the extension CSP to FreshRSS CSP."
msgstr ""

