#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/index.md:9
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Learning how to handle a new application is not always easy. We’ve tried to "
"make FreshRSS as intuitive as possible, but you might still need a little "
"help to master the program."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/index.md:11
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"This section will guide you to the pages you need to get started. The order "
"is tailored to newcomers."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: en/./users/index.md:12
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add Feeds"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/index.md:15
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"[After installing the application](../admins/installation.md), the first "
"step is to add some feeds. You have a few options:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: en/./users/index.md:19
#, markdown-text
msgid "[Add a feed manually](subscriptions.md#adding-a-feed)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: en/./users/index.md:19
#, markdown-text
msgid "[Import an OPML or JSON file](subscriptions.md#import-and-export)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: en/./users/index.md:19
#, markdown-text
msgid "[Use the bookmarklet](subscriptions.md#use-bookmarklet)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: en/./users/index.md:20
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Reading Views"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/index.md:23
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Once you have added your feeds to FreshRSS, it is time to read them. There "
"are three available reading modes:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: en/./users/index.md:27
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"[The normal view](views.md#normal-view) enables you to quickly read new "
"articles"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: en/./users/index.md:27
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"[The global view](views.md#global-view) shows you an overview of the status "
"of your feeds in one glance"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: en/./users/index.md:27
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"[The reader view](views.md#reader-view) offers you a comfortable reading "
"experience"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: en/./users/index.md:28
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Customize"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/index.md:31
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Now that you’ve mastered basic use, it’s time to configure FreshRSS to "
"improve your reading experience. It’s highly configurable, so it’s "
"recommended to play around with them to find a configuration that suits you "
"well. Here are a few resources to help you improve your daily FreshRSS "
"experience:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/index.md:42
#, markdown-text
msgid "[Organize your feeds in categories](subscriptions.md#feed-management)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/index.md:42
#, markdown-text
msgid "[Change the home page](configuration.md#changing-the-view)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/index.md:42
