#, markdown-text
msgid "[For Form Authentication (Web form)](#for-form-authentication-web-form)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#: en/./users/refreshing-feeds.md:23
#, markdown-text
msgid "[For HTTP authentication](#for-http-authentication)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
