#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/subscriptions.md:29
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"**Display position:** Defines the order of categories. Lower numbers get "
"priority, non-numbered items come last, and equally numbered items will sort "
"by alphabetical order."
