msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/views.md:10
#, markdown-text
msgid "FreshRSS has three primary viewing modes: Normal, Global, and Reader view."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: en/./users/views.md:11
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Normal view"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/views.md:14
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Normal view will allow you to view articles in a compressed view. They can "
"be separated by category or individual feed, or viewed in the \"main "
"stream\" containing all feeds. Clicking a feed in the sidebar (mobile users "
"will need to click the folder icon to open it) will open that feed’s view."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: en/./users/views.md:15
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Article List"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/views.md:18
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"By default, the normal view includes six items per article. From left to "
"right:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/views.md:25
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"**Read status:** An envelope icon to show if the article has been read or "
"not. Closed envelopes are unread, open envelopes are read. Clicking on the "
"icon will toggle the read status."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/views.md:25
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"**Favourite status:** A star icon to show if the article has been favourited "
"or not. Filled stars are favourited, empty stars are not. Clicking on the "
"icon will toggle the favourite status."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/views.md:25
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"**Feed name:** The name of the feed that the article is from. Clicking the "
"feed name will move to that feed’s view in normal view."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/views.md:25
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"**Article title:** The title of the article. Clicking will open the article "
"for viewing within FreshRSS."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/views.md:25
#, markdown-text
msgid "**Article date/time:** The time the article was posted."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/views.md:25
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"**Link to original article:** A globe icon that can be clicked to go to the "
"article on the original website."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: en/./users/views.md:26
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Normal View Sidebar"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/views.md:29
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Clicking the gear icon next to an individual feed will display additional "
"options for that feed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/views.md:36
#, markdown-text
msgid "**Filter:** Run the defined filter to mark articles as read"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/views.md:36
#, markdown-text
msgid "**Statistics:** View statistics about the feed"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/views.md:36
#, markdown-text
msgid "**See website:** Open the feed’s website in another tab"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/views.md:36
#, markdown-text
msgid "**Manage:** Configure the feed"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/views.md:36
#, markdown-text
msgid "**Actualize:** Force-update the feed"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/views.md:36
#, markdown-text
msgid "**Mark as read:** Mark all items in the feed as read"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: en/./users/views.md:37
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Global view"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/views.md:40
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Global view allows quick views of feed’s statuses at once. Feeds and "
"categories are shown with the number of unread articles next to "
"them. Clicking a feed’s name will open it in a view similar to normal view."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: en/./users/views.md:41
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Reader view"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/views.md:44
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Reader view will display a feed will all articles already open for "
"reading. Feeds can be switched by clicking the folder icon at the top to "
"bring up the category/feed sidebar."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/views.md:47
#, markdown-text
msgid "Read more:"
msgstr ""

