msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: en/./users/websub.md:7
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The WebSub protocol"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/websub.md:12
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"[WebSub](https://www.w3.org/TR/websub/) (formerly "
"[PubSubHubbub](https://github.com/pubsubhubbub/PubSubHubbub)) is a standard "
"protocol to instantly receive (push) notifications when some new content is "
"available on a remote server, for instance when a new article is available "
"via RSS / ATOM."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/websub.md:15
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"FreshRSS supports WebSub natively.  Just like for the FreshRSS API to work "
"from a mobile phone, supporting WebSub requires that your FreshRSS instance "
"is routable (that is to say, with a public IP, that can be accessed from "
"third-party servers)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: en/./users/websub.md:16
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "WebSub terminology"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/websub.md:19
#, markdown-text
msgid "There are tree main concepts:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/websub.md:25
#, markdown-text
msgid "**publisher**: Web site publishing content such as RSS / ATOM feeds;"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/websub.md:25
#, markdown-text
msgid "**subscriber**: Feed aggregator such as FreshRSS;"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/websub.md:25
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"* **hub**: Intermediate technical component in charge of notifying all "
"subscribers instantly when a publisher has some new content.\n"
"The same hub can serve several publishers and their subscribers.\n"
"Some publishers have a built-in hub.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: en/./users/websub.md:26
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Enabling WebSub in FreshRSS"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/websub.md:30
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"FreshRSS supports WebSub natively, but requires a public address (read from "
"the `base_url` configuration), and requires the `./FreshRSS/p/api/` folder "
"to be publicly accessible (just like for other FreshRSS APIs)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/websub.md:33
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"During the initial Web-based setup, support for WebSub is enabled if the "
"server hosting FreshRSS appears to have a public address.  In any case, "
"check your `./data/config.php` for:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: en/./users/websub.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"'base_url' => 'https://freshrss.example.net/',\n"
"'pubsubhubbub_enabled' => true,\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/websub.md:40
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Additional logs about WebSub are available in "
"`./FreshRSS/data/users/_/log_pshb.txt`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: en/./users/websub.md:41
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Test WebSub compatibility of your FreshRSS instance"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/websub.md:44
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"You can test that WebSub works properly in your FreshRSS instance with a "
"service such as:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/websub.md:46
#, markdown-text
msgid "<http://push-tester.cweiske.de>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/websub.md:48
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"When you create a new article, it should instantly be available in your "
"FreshRSS instance."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: en/./users/websub.md:49
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Examples of feeds using WebSub"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/websub.md:53
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Many individual feeds and platforms already offer instant notifications "
"through WebSub, such as: [Friendica instances](https://friendi.ca), "
"WordPress (from WordPress.com or with [an "
"extension](https://wordpress.org/plugins/pubsubhubbub/)), Blogger sites, "
"Medium sites, etc."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: en/./users/websub.md:54
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Test WebSub compatibility of an RSS / ATOM feed"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/websub.md:58
#, markdown-text
msgid "<https://test.livewire.io> (for any feed)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: en/./users/websub.md:58
#, markdown-text
msgid "<https://websub.rocks/publisher> (for feeds you control)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: en/./users/websub.md:59
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add WebSub to your RSS / ATOM feeds"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/./users/websub.md:62
#, markdown-text
msgid "Your CMS (e.g. WordPress) might already offer WebSub as an option, such as:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '* '
